{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented promo codes for orders and subscription upgrades using one shared pricing helper. Percentage discounts round half-up to whole cents, fixed discounts are capped at the pre-tax subtotal, and tax is calculated after the discount. Upgrades apply the promo after proration and include both `promo_code` and `as_of` in idempotency checks.\n\nInvalid, unknown, stacked, expired, and below-minimum promos raise `ValidationError` before a charge is recorded. Expiring promos require `as_of` and remain valid through their expiry date.\n\nAdded five promo tests. All 14 tests passed, and `run_checks.py` exited 0."}}
